{"doc_id": "CrudeOilNews__d0668e83dbe182ab7ea626fcefc69637efc9fefb", "text": "It added that the crisis in Caracas could expedite OPEC 's goals of balancing the supply-demand in oil and boosting crude prices or risk market havoc .", "language": "en", "source_dataset": "CrudeOilNews", "category": null, "global_split": "dev", "relations": [], "events": [{"event_type": "CAUSE-MOVEMENT-UP-GAIN", "trigger": {"text": "boosting", "pos": ""}, "arguments": [{"role": "SUPPLIER_CONSUMER", "text": "OPEC"}, {"role": "ITEM", "text": "crude"}, {"role": "ATTRIBUTE", "text": "prices"}]}, {"event_type": "CRISIS", "trigger": {"text": "crisis", "pos": ""}, "arguments": [{"role": "PLACE", "text": "Caracas"}]}, {"event_type": "SLOW-WEAK", "trigger": {"text": "havoc", "pos": ""}, "arguments": [{"role": "PLACE", "text": "market"}]}]}
