{"doc_id": "CrudeOilNews__147795ddbf756cba5794acf828b084d5dbe0f023", "text": "The report also showed that total motor gasoline inventories decreased by 1.2 million barrels , compared to forecasts for a gain of 0.4 million barrels , while distillate stockpiles rose by 1.0 million barrels , above expectations for an increase of 0.8 million barrels .", "language": "en", "source_dataset": "CrudeOilNews", "category": null, "global_split": "dev", "relations": [], "events": [{"event_type": "MOVEMENT-DOWN-LOSS", "trigger": {"text": "decreased", "pos": ""}, "arguments": [{"role": "ITEM", "text": "gasoline"}, {"role": "ATTRIBUTE", "text": "inventories"}, {"role": "DIFFERENCE", "text": "1.2 million barrels"}]}, {"event_type": "MOVEMENT-UP-GAIN", "trigger": {"text": "gain", "pos": ""}, "arguments": [{"role": "FORECAST", "text": "forecasts"}, {"role": "DIFFERENCE", "text": "0.4 million barrels"}]}, {"event_type": "MOVEMENT-UP-GAIN", "trigger": {"text": "rose", "pos": ""}, "arguments": [{"role": "ITEM", "text": "distillate"}, {"role": "ATTRIBUTE", "text": "stockpiles"}, {"role": "DIFFERENCE", "text": "1.0 million barrels"}]}, {"event_type": "MOVEMENT-UP-GAIN", "trigger": {"text": "increase", "pos": ""}, "arguments": [{"role": "DIFFERENCE", "text": "0.8 million barrels"}]}]}
