{"doc_id": "CrudeOilNews__44e0a7baf4e4d863d5b7943aff3ddef71df1d79b", "text": "The U.S. government also reported that total motor gasoline inventories decreased by 572,000 barrels , less than expectations for a decline of 852,000 barrels .", "language": "en", "source_dataset": "CrudeOilNews", "category": null, "global_split": "dev", "relations": [], "events": [{"event_type": "MOVEMENT-DOWN-LOSS", "trigger": {"text": "decreased", "pos": ""}, "arguments": [{"role": "SUPPLIER_CONSUMER", "text": "U.S."}, {"role": "ITEM", "text": "gasoline"}, {"role": "ATTRIBUTE", "text": "inventories"}, {"role": "DIFFERENCE", "text": "572,000 barrels"}]}, {"event_type": "MOVEMENT-DOWN-LOSS", "trigger": {"text": "decline", "pos": ""}, "arguments": [{"role": "FINAL_VALUE", "text": "852,000 barrels"}]}]}
