{"doc_id": "CrudeOilNews__1aa345f5cef69b0ce890b5d434cde750e78a037e", "text": "Elsewhere , prices rose ahead of seasonal refinery closures , when facilities are tweaked to produce gasoline and other products better suited for colder weather .", "language": "en", "source_dataset": "CrudeOilNews", "category": null, "global_split": "dev", "relations": [], "events": [{"event_type": "MOVEMENT-UP-GAIN", "trigger": {"text": "rose", "pos": ""}, "arguments": [{"role": "ATTRIBUTE", "text": "prices"}]}]}
